"""
Project generator for: Real Estate Inventory Bot with Telegram Integration

This Python script *creates* the full project files (API, models, bot, README, tests) in the current directory.

Why this approach?
- Previously a stray plain-text line in the canvas caused a SyntaxError when the user executed the document as Python.
- To guarantee the canvas is valid Python, this file is a *generator script* that writes all project files to disk. Running it will produce the runnable project files without any stray text errors.

Usage:
    python create_project.py

After running, follow README.md in the generated project folder to install deps and run the API and Telegram bot.
"""

